MCP (Model Context Protocol) server for OPNsense.

Runs natively on the firewall as an OPNsense plugin, exposing read-only
inspection tools (interfaces, firewall rules, ARP, routes, services, VLANs,
DHCP leases, WireGuard, HAProxy) that AI assistants query through typed MCP
tool calls instead of screen-scraping the web UI or hand-writing API scripts.

Read-only by design — no write tools exist. Auth via bearer token, managed
through the OPNsense web UI under Services > MCP Server.

WWW: https://github.com/JamesonRGrieve/opnsense-mcp
